            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Monique"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was fantastic! After reading the reviews I ended up making a few changes. I used 3 eggs, added 1 tsp of Red Hot, and 1 Tbs of Zatarains Creole seasoning, salt, pepper. I sautéd mushrooms, sweet red peppers (pimentos) green onion with fresh garlic and added it to the egg mixture. This is a delicious recipe, thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2020-09-04T03:09:36.473Z"
          },
          {
