            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "karalyn16"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Unlike apparently every other commenter, I LIKE fake crab. I know it doesn't taste like crab, I like it for what it is. The only changes I made were adding an extra egg as suggested, a few generous slugs of Tabasco, and I added closer to 1 1/2 cups of crab. It was great!",
